Upstream: https://github.com/httplib2/httplib2/commit/5fee2b095f49a6ad5e1f0a185d909c89199e4dc9
Signed-off-by: Titouan Christophe <titouan.christophe@mind.be>
---
 httplib2/cacerts.txt | 33 ---------------------------------
